  "details": "Could recievers operate with a bool parameter? A \"toggle on enter\" of sorts?\nFor example, I've been building toggle buttons, but being limited to floats requires a bunch of extra parameters with 'greater/less' checks, empty wait states and parameter drivers to flip switches.\nMaybe I'm not doing it right? In any case... I think some bool logic would be useful.\nI added a screenshot of a 'toggle' setup that has to cycle through states with greater checks and parameter drivers. I think, with a bool toggle, this could be three states instead of six.",
